    "description": "[REVIEW] A caught Impostor gets one guess at the secret word: right, the Impostor wins; wrong, the civilians win. If a civilian is voted out, the Impostor wins.. Spec key tutorial.guess_body; draft from SCREEN_SPECIFICATIONS.md Appendix A, merged under D-26. Not reviewed."
